{"when": "2026-10-10T15:21:22Z", "item": "db-06", "action": "status", "from": "started", "to": "done", "note": ".ball is now a native DuckDB file. Open is read-only by default, with writable: true enabling writes. Config history lives in _databall, and saves stamp the last writer with engine version, storage tag, and written_at. SaveAsync uses COPY FROM DATABASE to save the whole session; it throws inside a store transaction, over a path held by another in-process session, or when a read-only session saves to its own path. ImportAsync(.ball) attaches the file read-only and merges only columns, relationships, tables, and metadata. ZIP .ball v1/v2 and BallManifest have been removed. Final Release test counts are 423 library tests and 30 CLI tests. The final reviewer gate passed with VERDICT: PASS.", "by": "Jon R"}
